  - key: animal.crow
    hint: intelligent all-black bird (Corvus corone), a member of the corvid family
    image: animal.crow.png
    brief:
      subject: a glossy jet-black crow perched on a bare branch, iridescent feathers catching the light, alert yellow eyes, sharp beak, overcast autumn sky

  - key: animal.pigeon
    hint: grey urban dove found worldwide (Columba livia domestica)
    image: animal.pigeon.png
    brief:
      subject: a city pigeon perched on a stone ledge, grey plumage with iridescent green and purple neck, round body, soft urban background

  - key: animal.sparrow
    hint: small brown bird common in gardens (Passer domesticus)
    image: animal.sparrow.png
    brief:
      subject: a house sparrow perched on a wooden garden fence, brown and grey streaked feathers, plump round body, warm natural light

  - key: animal.robin
    hint: small bird with a distinctive red-orange breast (Erithacus rubecula)
    image: animal.robin.png
    brief:
      subject: a European robin perched on a frost-covered branch, vivid orange-red breast, brown back, bright alert eyes, winter garden setting

  - key: animal.duck
    hint: common waterbird with a flat bill (Anas platyrhynchos), the mallard
    image: animal.duck.png
    brief:
      subject: a male mallard duck swimming on a calm pond, iridescent green head, bright yellow bill, chestnut-brown breast, green reeds reflected in water

  - key: animal.swan
    hint: large white waterbird with a graceful long neck (Cygnus olor)
    image: animal.swan.png
    brief:
      subject: a mute swan gliding on a still lake, pure white plumage, graceful S-curved neck, orange bill with black knob, soft morning reflections on water

  - key: animal.goose
    hint: large grey or white waterbird honking loudly (Anser anser)
    image: animal.goose.png
    brief:
      subject: a greylag goose standing on a green grassy bank, brown-grey plumage, pale orange-pink bill, alert posture, natural countryside lighting

  - key: animal.stork
    hint: large white bird with red legs and beak that nests on rooftops (Ciconia ciconia)
    image: animal.stork.png
    brief:
      subject: a white stork standing in its large stick nest on a chimney top, white and black plumage, long red beak, long red legs, bright blue sky

  - key: animal.heron
    hint: tall wading bird that stands still to catch fish (Ardea cinerea)
    image: animal.heron.png
    brief:
      subject: a grey heron standing perfectly still in shallow water, grey plumage with white head and black crest, sharp yellow dagger beak, long legs, river reeds

  - key: animal.crane
    hint: tall elegant grey bird with a red crown (Grus grus), migratory
    image: animal.crane.png
    brief:
      subject: a common crane walking across a misty autumn field, grey plumage, bright red crown patch, long neck and legs, early morning mist in background

  - key: animal.ostrich
    hint: world's largest bird that cannot fly but runs very fast (Struthio camelus)
    image: animal.ostrich.png
    brief:
      subject: a running ostrich on the African savanna, long powerful legs in motion, black and white feathers, long neck outstretched, dry grass and blue sky

  - key: animal.emu
    hint: large flightless bird native to Australia (Dromaius novaehollandiae)
    image: animal.emu.png
    brief:
      subject: an emu walking across red Australian outback, shaggy brown-grey feathers, long neck, small vestigial wings, bright blue sky, sparse dry vegetation

  - key: animal.pelican
    hint: large water bird with a huge throat pouch for catching fish (Pelecanus)
    image: animal.pelican.png
    brief:
      subject: a great white pelican perched on coastal rocks, brilliant white plumage, enormous orange-yellow throat pouch, large hooked bill, blue sea behind

  - key: animal.puffin
    hint: small seabird with a brightly coloured triangular bill (Fratercula arctica)
    image: animal.puffin.png
    brief:
      subject: an Atlantic puffin standing on a rocky sea cliff, black and white plumage, vivid orange-red and yellow triangular beak, compact round body, grey ocean behind

  - key: animal.albatross
    hint: huge seabird with the longest wingspan of any living bird (Diomedea)
    image: animal.albatross.png
    brief:
      subject: a wandering albatross soaring over open ocean, enormous wingspan fully spread, white body with dark wingtips, dramatic stormy clouds, ocean waves below

  - key: animal.seagull
    hint: common coastal bird with a loud call (Larus argentatus), herring gull
    image: animal.seagull.png
    brief:
      subject: a herring gull perched on a seaside rock, white body, pale grey wings, yellow bill with red spot, bright coastal sky and waves in background

  - key: animal.hawk
    hint: medium-sized bird of prey with broad wings (Accipiter / Buteo)
    image: animal.hawk.png
    brief:
      subject: a red-tailed hawk perched on a wooden fence post, reddish-brown tail, mottled brown and cream plumage, sharp talons gripping, piercing yellow eyes, open countryside

  - key: animal.falcon
    hint: fast streamlined bird of prey with pointed wings (Falco), the peregrine
    image: animal.falcon.png
    brief:
      subject: a peregrine falcon perched on a rocky ledge, blue-grey back, white chest with dark speckles, distinctive dark moustache stripe, yellow eye-ring, dramatic sky

  - key: animal.woodpecker
    hint: bird that drills holes in tree bark to find insects (Picidae)
    image: animal.woodpecker.png
    brief:
      subject: a great spotted woodpecker clinging to an oak trunk, bold black and white patterned plumage, vivid red cap, powerful chisel beak, bark texture in sharp focus

  - key: animal.cuckoo
    hint: bird known for laying eggs in other birds' nests and its distinctive call (Cuculus canorus)
    image: animal.cuckoo.png
    brief:
      subject: a common cuckoo perched on a leafy branch, grey head and back, white barred underparts, long graduated tail, bright spring green leaves surrounding

  - key: animal.kingfisher
    hint: small brilliantly coloured bird that dives for fish (Alcedo atthis)
    image: animal.kingfisher.png
    brief:
      subject: a common kingfisher perched on a low branch over a river, electric iridescent blue-green back, vivid orange underparts, dagger beak, water glinting below

  - key: animal.canary
    hint: small bright yellow singing bird kept as a pet (Serinus canaria)
    image: animal.canary.png
    brief:
      subject: a bright yellow canary perched on a natural twig, vivid lemon-yellow plumage, small round body, beak slightly open as if singing, warm soft light

  - key: animal.nightingale
    hint: small brown bird famous for its beautiful complex night song (Luscinia megarhynchos)
    image: animal.nightingale.png
    brief:
      subject: a nightingale perched in dense thicket, plain brown plumage, warm reddish-brown tail, beak open mid-song, dusk golden light filtering through leaves

  - key: animal.dove
    hint: small peaceful white or grey bird symbolising peace (Columba livia / Streptopelia)
    image: animal.dove.png
    brief:
      subject: a turtle dove perched on a blossoming branch, pinkish-grey plumage, scaly black and orange neck patch, gentle expression, soft pastel bokeh background

  - key: animal.raven
    hint: large all-black corvid larger than a crow, very intelligent (Corvus corax)
    image: animal.raven.png
    brief:
      subject: a common raven perched on a stone wall, very large, completely glossy black plumage, massive curved beak, intelligent eyes, dramatic overcast sky background

  - key: animal.magpie
    hint: black and white corvid with a long iridescent tail (Pica pica)
    image: animal.magpie.png
    brief:
      subject: a Eurasian magpie perched on a garden fence, bold black and white plumage, long iridescent blue-green tail, sharp black beak, natural garden background

  - key: animal.swallow
    hint: fast aerial bird with forked tail that eats insects in flight (Hirundo rustica)
    image: animal.swallow.png
    brief:
      subject: a barn swallow in swooping flight, glossy blue-black back, rusty-red forehead, white belly, elegant long forked tail streaming, bright summer blue sky

  - key: animal.condor
    hint: huge scavenging vulture, one of the world's largest flying birds (Vultur gryphus)
    image: animal.condor.png
    brief:
      subject: an Andean condor soaring on thermals above mountain peaks, enormous wingspan, black body with white ruff collar, bald red head, dramatic Andean sky

  - key: animal.macaw
    hint: large colourful tropical parrot with long tail (Ara species)
    image: animal.macaw.png
    brief:
      subject: a scarlet macaw perched on a tropical branch, vivid crimson red body, bright yellow and blue wing feathers, long streaming tail, strong curved beak, jungle canopy

  - key: animal.cockatoo
    hint: large white crested parrot from Australia (Cacatuidae)
    image: animal.cockatoo.png
    brief:
      subject: a sulphur-crested cockatoo perched on a eucalyptus branch, brilliant white plumage, vivid yellow crest feathers raised, grey-black beak, blue Australian sky

  - key: animal.budgerigar
    hint: small green and yellow parakeet commonly kept as a pet (Melopsittacus undulatus)
    image: animal.budgerigar.png
    brief:
      subject: a budgerigar parakeet perched on a natural branch, vivid lime green and yellow plumage, blue cere above beak, black scalloped markings on back, soft light

  - key: animal.hornbill
    hint: tropical bird with an enormous curved bill and casque on top (Bucerotidae)
    image: animal.hornbill.png
    brief:
      subject: a great hornbill perched on a tropical branch, dramatic black and white plumage, enormous curved yellow bill with large yellow casque, tropical rainforest backdrop

  - key: animal.roadrunner
    hint: fast ground-running bird from American deserts (Geococcyx californianus)
    image: animal.roadrunner.png
    brief:
      subject: a greater roadrunner sprinting across desert terrain, streaked brown plumage, long tail, crest raised, powerful legs mid-stride, Sonoran desert scrub

  - key: animal.kookaburra
    hint: large tree kingfisher from Australia with a laughing call (Dacelo novaeguineae)
    image: animal.kookaburra.png
    brief:
      subject: a laughing kookaburra perched on a branch, large rounded head, brown and white plumage, strong straight beak, alert posture, eucalyptus leaves around

  - key: animal.ibis
    hint: wading bird with a long curved downward beak (Threskiornithidae)
    image: animal.ibis.png
    brief:
      subject: a sacred ibis wading in shallow water, white plumage, bare black head and neck, long downward curved black beak, African wetland reeds in background

  - key: animal.spoonbill
    hint: wading bird with a spoon-shaped bill tip (Platalea)
    image: animal.spoonbill.png
    brief:
      subject: a Eurasian spoonbill wading in a wetland, white plumage with pink flush, distinctive spatula-shaped bill sweeping water, long legs, reed beds in background

  - key: animal.secretary_bird
    hint: tall eagle-like bird that walks and stomps on snakes (Sagittarius serpentarius)
    image: animal.secretary_bird.png
    brief:
      subject: a secretary bird striding through African savanna grass, tall eagle-like build, long black crest feathers, orange facial skin, powerful long legs, vast open plain

  - key: animal.cassowary
    hint: large flightless bird from New Guinea with a bony casque (Casuarius)
    image: animal.cassowary.png
    brief:
      subject: a southern cassowary in tropical rainforest, striking blue and red neck, large dark-brown body, prominent bony helmet casque, powerful clawed feet, lush green undergrowth

  - key: animal.lyrebird
    hint: Australian ground bird with an extraordinary tail mimicking sounds (Menura)
    image: animal.lyrebird.png
    brief:
      subject: a superb lyrebird male displaying on the forest floor, magnificent lyre-shaped tail fanned out, intricate outer feathers curved, brown body, Australian fern forest setting

  - key: animal.quail
    hint: small plump ground-dwelling bird with a bobbing call (Coturnix coturnix)
    image: animal.quail.png
    brief:
      subject: a common quail walking through a wheat field, small rotund brown streaked body, buff-white eye stripe, stubby tail, golden wheat stems at eye level

  - key: animal.pheasant
    hint: large colourful game bird with a long tail (Phasianus colchicus)
    image: animal.pheasant.png
    brief:
      subject: a male common pheasant standing in autumn field, iridescent green head, red facial wattle, golden-copper body, long barred tail, warm golden harvest light
